OL,3,GNEWSACoolcations: 'They used to joke
OL,4,Aabout our weather - now they can't wait
OL,5,Afor the rain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's a beautiful day on a sea loch near
OL,8,FGlencoe with light winds and calm
OL,9,Fwaters.
OL,11,FThe seals are out but they are not
OL,12,Fbasking in the sunshine and neither are
OL,13,Fthe holidaymakers who've come to kayak
OL,14,Fon Loch Leven's placid surface.
OL,16,FWhile much of Europe and large parts of
OL,17,FEngland and Wales have sweltered in
OL,18,Frecord-breaking heat this summer, the
OL,19,Fweather here is overcast and relatively
OL,20,Fcool.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
