OL,3,GNEWSACoolcations: 'They used to joke
OL,4,Aabout our weather - now they can't wait
OL,5,Afor the rain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut for an increasing number of
OL,8,Ftourists that is part of the attraction
OL,9,F- they are heading to Scotland not to
OL,10,Fsunbathe but to seek respite from the
OL,11,Fheat on what have become known as
OL,12,F"coolcations".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
